msgid "PC5 can't name the game's folder on the USB drive."
msgstr "PC5 kan ikke navngive spillets mappe på USB-drevet."

#: title/pc5_library.c:2353
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The drive reads at %.0f MB/s here, too slow to play from (%.0f needed). "
"Plug it into a port on the back or the front USB-C port. Installing to the "
"console still works."
msgstr ""
"Drevet læser med %.0f MB/s her, for langsomt til at spille fra (%.0f "
"kræves). Sæt det i en port bagpå eller i USB-C-porten foran. Installation "
"på konsollen virker stadig."

#: title/pc5_library.c:2361
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Not enough space on the USB drive: the game needs %s and it has %s free."
msgstr ""
"Ikke nok plads på USB-drevet: Spillet kræver %s, og der er %s ledigt."

#: title/pc5_library.c:2365
msgid ""
"Only a game on a USB drive can play from it: this folder isn't on one."
msgstr ""
"Kun et spil på et USB-drev kan spilles derfra: Denne mappe ligger ikke på "
"et."

#: title/pc5_library.c:2367
msgid "A game in PC5's INSTALL folder is installed, not played from there."
msgstr ""
"Et spil i PC5's INSTALL-mappe bliver installeret, ikke spillet derfra."

#: title/pc5_library.c:2372
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The drive reads at %.0f MB/s in this USB port, too slow to play from (at "
"least %.0f is needed). On the original PS5 the front USB-A port is the "
"slow one: plug the drive into a port on the back, or the front USB-C port. "
"Install still works from this port."
msgstr ""
"Drevet læser med %.0f MB/s i denne USB-port, for langsomt til at spille "
"fra (mindst %.0f kræves). På den originale PS5 er USB-A-porten foran den "
"langsomme: Sæt drevet i en port bagpå eller i USB-C-porten foran. "
"Installation virker stadig fra denne port."

#: title/pc5_library.c:2378
msgid "The game's program is too deep in its folder for Windows."
msgstr "Spillets program ligger for dybt i mappen til Windows."

#: title/pc5_library.c:2386
#, c-format
msgid "Not enough space: the game needs %s and the console has %s free."
msgstr "Ikke nok plads: Spillet kræver %s, og konsollen har %s ledigt."

#: title/pc5_library.c:2389
msgid "PC5 can't name the game."
msgstr "PC5 kan ikke navngive spillet."

#: title/pc5_library.c:2392
#, c-format
msgid "PC5 can't start the install: %s."
msgstr "PC5 kan ikke starte installationen: %s."

#: title/pc5_library.c:2399 title/pc5_library.c:2472 title/pc5_library.c:2508
#: title/pc5_library.c:2757
msgid "Out of memory."
msgstr "Ikke nok hukommelse."

#: title/pc5_library.c:2432
msgid "A path in the Windows template is too long."
msgstr "En sti i Windows-skabelonen er for lang."

#: title/pc5_library.c:2435 title/pc5_library.c:2440 title/pc5_library.c:2943
