msgstr "Slet de gemte data for %s?"

#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:8675
msgid ""
"Its saves and settings, kept when it was uninstalled, are deleted. There "
"is no backup and no undo."
msgstr ""
"Dets gemte data og indstillinger, der blev beholdt ved afinstallationen, "
"slettes. Der er ingen sikkerhedskopi, og det kan ikke fortrydes."

