"ind i PC5's bibliotek, ud af INSTALL-mappen."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:8729
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%d game is waiting in PC5's INSTALL folder. Install it now? A game "
"installed from there is moved into PC5's library, out of the INSTALL "
"folder."
msgstr ""
"%d spil venter i PC5's INSTALL-mappe. Installer det nu? Et spil, der "
"installeres derfra, flyttes ind i PC5's bibliotek, ud af INSTALL-mappen."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:8729
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%d games are waiting in PC5's INSTALL folder. Install them now? A game "
"installed from there is moved into PC5's library, out of the INSTALL "
"folder."
msgstr ""
"%d spil venter i PC5's INSTALL-mappe. Installer dem nu? Et spil, der "
"installeres derfra, flyttes ind i PC5's bibliotek, ud af INSTALL-mappen."

#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:8741
msgid "Games in PC5's INSTALL folder"
msgstr "Spil i PC5's INSTALL-mappe"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:8746
msgid "Updating the home screen tile"
msgstr "Opdaterer feltet på startskærmen"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:8746
msgid "Its picture and background"
msgstr "Dets billede og baggrund"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:8748
msgid "A newer one may have fixed it"
msgstr "En nyere version har måske rettet det"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:8751
#, c-format
msgid "Update to PC5 %s first?"
msgstr "Opdater til PC5 %s først?"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:8753
#, c-format
